WEBVTT

00:03.120 --> 00:04.896
A one-on-one duel.

00:05.344 --> 00:08.816
If you win, I'll officially
recognize you as our boss.

00:09.168 --> 00:11.072
A duel…?!

00:11.520 --> 00:16.192
Don't be stupid! Are you telling me
to fight one of them?!

00:16.224 --> 00:18.688
You don't have to fight.

00:19.296 --> 00:21.664
I'll allow you to pick a stand-in.

00:22.432 --> 00:24.560
You can choose any one of us.

00:25.168 --> 00:27.392
Why would I do that?!

00:27.392 --> 00:29.424
I'm Albert Gambino!

00:29.424 --> 00:32.928
I have no need to listen to anything you say!

00:33.456 --> 00:37.568
Pathetic. Shut up and get ready to fight.

00:37.984 --> 00:41.504
I'm embarrassed as a fellow boss.

00:42.016 --> 00:44.512
Finocchio Barzini?!

00:44.912 --> 00:46.784
Where are your manners?

00:46.784 --> 00:50.464
That's Miss Finocchio to you.

00:50.816 --> 00:52.496
Why are you…

00:52.496 --> 00:53.952
Why?

00:55.264 --> 00:59.600
To serve as a witness to the duel, of course.

01:00.128 --> 01:01.760
A witness?!

01:01.760 --> 01:05.072
He's here by my invitation, of course.

01:05.616 --> 01:07.504
With those drugs creating unrest,

01:07.872 --> 01:13.392
Finocchio's been looking for
a chance like this to crush the Gambinos.

01:13.952 --> 01:20.096
I'll receive a fifty million fil reward
if I oust you in this duel.

01:20.720 --> 01:23.216
Is that so… I get it!

01:23.216 --> 01:26.085
So you're the mastermind, you mad clown!

01:26.176 --> 01:30.480
No, you silly goose. I didn't do anything.

01:30.688 --> 01:33.440
The one who got you in this position
is our darling Noel.

01:33.520 --> 01:35.729
No! I don't believe you!

01:35.776 --> 01:37.696
Suit yourself.

01:37.838 --> 01:41.888
But won't you hurry and pick a stand-in?

01:41.936 --> 01:44.624
I'm on a tight schedule here.

01:44.896 --> 01:47.536
I never agreed to a duel!

01:47.536 --> 01:48.800
It's not up to you to…

01:49.456 --> 01:53.648
We're not here for you to run
your mouth at me, you vermin!

01:53.648 --> 01:57.760
If you're a boss, then show
some resolve, you fool!

01:57.760 --> 02:03.632
You better be prepared for the consequences
if you keep this shit up!

02:04.432 --> 02:06.256
F-Fine.

02:06.640 --> 02:09.712
But if my guy wins…

02:09.856 --> 02:14.480
Yes, I'll recognize you as boss in that case.

02:14.480 --> 02:20.304
And I'll even smooth things over with Papa
about that embarrassing scene at the Seeker bar.

02:22.208 --> 02:24.480
So? Who will you choose?

02:29.008 --> 02:32.288
You, Koga! Fight in my place!

02:32.784 --> 02:35.488
He chose exactly who you said he would.

02:36.128 --> 02:39.696
Yeah. Koga is bound by a contract of servitude.

02:40.176 --> 02:43.472
He can't betray Albert like the other grunts.

02:43.840 --> 02:45.808
Now I can kill him.

02:46.656 --> 02:49.073
Sorry, but I'm fighting him.

02:49.167 --> 02:51.296
Huh?! What do you mean?!

02:51.296 --> 02:52.016
- You can't possibly beat…

02:52.016 --> 02:53.296
- You must still be green if you think that.
- You can't possibly beat…

02:53.296 --> 02:56.224
- You must still be green if you think that.

03:00.736 --> 03:02.976
Stay there and be patient.

04:40.752 --> 04:43.104
Third time's the charm, huh?

04:44.880 --> 04:47.008
That's it. Those eyes.

04:47.952 --> 04:51.808
Your eyes look like you've already won
before the fight's even begun.

04:52.480 --> 04:56.624
Your conviction that you're stronger
is unshakable.

04:57.568 --> 04:58.944
So I'm…

05:00.256 --> 05:02.144
You're raring to go, huh?

05:02.528 --> 05:05.344
But there's nothing in it for you if you win.

05:05.536 --> 05:06.656
I don't care.

05:07.184 --> 05:09.936
I'm just glad I get to fight you.

05:11.312 --> 05:12.752
I'm expecting a lot from you.

05:13.056 --> 05:15.808
If you're looking for a rematch…

05:16.656 --> 05:18.848
You must have some plan.

05:19.520 --> 05:21.744
I'm not smart, and even I can tell.

05:21.904 --> 05:23.648
I'm looking forward to it.

05:24.768 --> 05:27.152
I won't let you call me a coward anymore, then.

05:27.536 --> 05:29.968
You better come at me ready to kill.

05:31.536 --> 05:33.552
Third time's the charm!

05:37.056 --> 05:39.200
You may begin!

05:41.600 --> 05:42.624
Ice Bullet!

05:42.784 --> 05:44.192
Crazy Cherry Blossoms!

05:47.728 --> 05:50.896
I can't see the action like this.

05:50.896 --> 05:51.952
And it's freezing!

05:54.480 --> 05:57.824
Brother… Is this really the right choice?

05:58.288 --> 06:00.816
Yeah. I believe in him.

06:02.944 --> 06:03.904
It'll be okay.

06:03.904 --> 06:06.160
He may talk big, but he's just a Talker.

06:06.160 --> 06:09.040
The weakest Job can't possibly win.

06:23.056 --> 06:24.176
That stance!

06:24.528 --> 06:25.809
Iai Flash.

06:26.060 --> 06:30.096
A skill that greatly boosts his attack speed
and power when he draws his sword.

06:30.512 --> 06:33.200
If I give him the chance,
he'll slice me in two instantly.

06:34.624 --> 06:36.752
But it's not worth fearing.

06:37.424 --> 06:39.824
The seeds have already been sown
to flip things my way.

06:40.304 --> 06:43.472
By Koga's own words, no less.

06:44.416 --> 06:46.624
You must have some plan.

06:49.888 --> 06:51.008
It's out of bullets.

06:51.552 --> 06:53.072
Let's end things here.

06:53.696 --> 06:56.944
But first, I have a useful tip for you.

06:57.680 --> 06:58.496
What is it?

07:00.832 --> 07:05.216
You can get stubborn grease stains out
by rubbing an orange peel on them!

07:07.008 --> 07:09.008
Huh? What on earth are you…

07:09.008 --> 07:09.856
Gotcha!

07:10.752 --> 07:12.176
"You must have a plan."

07:12.896 --> 07:16.240
That wariness delayed your immediate reaction.

07:20.208 --> 07:22.800
I'll have your arm!

07:23.616 --> 07:25.900
You're holding my blade in place
with your muscle?!

07:25.900 --> 07:27.296
Are you insane?!

07:33.600 --> 07:35.792
Don't look down on me!

07:39.184 --> 07:41.248
What am I…

07:45.264 --> 07:47.200
I said my gun was out of bullets.

07:47.200 --> 07:49.536
I never said I don't have any more.

07:51.008 --> 07:57.344
So your plan was in motion
as soon as the fight began.

07:58.448 --> 07:59.744
This man…

08:00.352 --> 08:01.184
Roaring Thunder.

08:08.800 --> 08:09.952
He's strong.

08:12.864 --> 08:16.128
I was afraid to stand up for myself
from a young age.

08:16.720 --> 08:18.816
I was a plague-bringer, unwanted by anyone.

08:20.080 --> 08:23.952
No one expected anything of me,
and I couldn't expect anything of anyone.

08:24.816 --> 08:28.304
Since the moment I was born, I was on the bottom.

08:29.408 --> 08:33.168
But when I was made a gladiator,
I fought tooth and nail.

08:33.760 --> 08:38.224
Ironically, risking my life in combat
made me stronger.

08:38.992 --> 08:44.320
But no matter how much
I trained my skills, I remained weak.

08:45.184 --> 08:48.848
Too weak to do anything I'm not ordered to do.

08:49.376 --> 08:50.112
We have a winner!

08:50.112 --> 08:51.744
Noel Stollen!

08:55.856 --> 08:58.544
You're not like me, Noel.

09:00.096 --> 09:05.088
Even being a Talker, the weakest Job,
you stayed strong at all times.

09:06.208 --> 09:07.840
Those self-assured eyes…

09:08.432 --> 09:11.712
What did you sacrifice to get those?

09:12.650 --> 09:14.000
Noel…

09:14.992 --> 09:17.056
If I were like you…

09:17.872 --> 09:20.176
Could I have fought for freedom?

09:21.232 --> 09:23.627
Could I have gone against my father?

09:24.768 --> 09:28.432
Could I have shouted at him to love me?

09:29.481 --> 09:30.969
I finally see.

09:32.208 --> 09:35.392
Noel, I wish I'd been like you.

09:36.656 --> 09:38.688
I wish I'd been strong.

09:40.832 --> 09:43.168
The match is over.

09:43.472 --> 09:46.528
My job is done. It's up to you now.

09:47.072 --> 09:48.800
Impressive fight.

09:49.312 --> 09:51.840
You're a true man.

09:52.128 --> 09:53.488
Thanks.

09:53.856 --> 09:55.120
I owe you now.

09:55.456 --> 09:57.056
If you're ever in hot water…

09:57.056 --> 09:59.008
I never made a loan to you.

09:59.776 --> 10:02.048
I don't need your help.

10:02.976 --> 10:04.384
Noel Stollen.

10:07.232 --> 10:08.256
I get it.

10:09.040 --> 10:09.744
Koga.

10:10.512 --> 10:12.848
I see why you fell for him.

10:18.208 --> 10:20.288
You're such a dummy, Noel.

10:20.288 --> 10:21.920
Ouch!

10:22.032 --> 10:26.848
Roaring Thunder. A kick that delivers enough force
to a foe's chest to stop their heart.

10:27.728 --> 10:29.984
That was reckless against a frontline opponent.

10:30.256 --> 10:32.112
I won, so what does it matter?

10:32.576 --> 10:34.384
That's not the problem.

10:34.384 --> 10:38.032
I'm your partner, and fighting is my job.

10:38.240 --> 10:40.592
Your job is to give orders, right?

10:41.056 --> 10:43.360
Don't take your partner's job away.

10:45.376 --> 10:47.648
Sorry. I won't do it again.

10:48.144 --> 10:50.400
Really? You promise?

10:50.706 --> 10:53.074
I promise. I swear on my grandpa.

10:55.799 --> 10:58.354
Let your big sister take care of you from now on.

10:58.464 --> 11:02.720
I keep telling you, you're not my… Whatever.

11:04.256 --> 11:06.736
The Gambinos are finished now.

11:07.200 --> 11:09.280
The drugs will stop circulating.

11:10.016 --> 11:13.088
And she can finally rest in peace.

11:15.904 --> 11:17.344
Good job!

11:17.344 --> 11:19.632
Can I have just a minute to talk with you?

11:19.952 --> 11:22.384
If this is about the money, it's already settled.

11:22.656 --> 11:23.885
I'm not giving you a discount.

11:23.994 --> 11:27.728
Why would I be such a miser?

11:27.728 --> 11:31.552
I'm happy to be able to take out
a competitor at no risk to me.

11:31.936 --> 11:36.160
But I want to talk between just the two of us,
so could you have her step out?

11:40.336 --> 11:41.888
What is it?

11:42.368 --> 11:46.272
I hate when people beat around the bush,
so I'll get straight to the point.

11:46.736 --> 11:49.776
Noel, join my family.

11:50.544 --> 11:52.064
It won't be a bad deal for you.

11:52.064 --> 11:55.104
I'll even let you lead the Gambino family.

11:55.552 --> 11:56.896
Me, a boss?

11:57.184 --> 12:00.385
Are you serious? I'm only sixteen.

12:00.550 --> 12:02.471
Age has nothing to do with it.

12:02.896 --> 12:04.674
It's your guts that matter.

12:04.816 --> 12:06.416
It's the same with Seekers, right?

12:06.720 --> 12:10.288
I guess. But I've already turned down that offer.

12:10.592 --> 12:13.152
I don't want to work for someone else.

12:13.568 --> 12:14.624
No matter what?

12:15.008 --> 12:16.672
No matter what.

12:18.176 --> 12:20.288
I see. That's too bad.

12:21.184 --> 12:24.368
Say, Noel… Do you know my Job?

12:26.864 --> 12:31.136
I'm an A-Rank Scout-class Job, Punisher.

12:31.184 --> 12:36.176
It's weaker in direct combat than other Jobs,
but it has several unique skills.

12:36.960 --> 12:39.280
What do you think this is?

12:42.352 --> 12:43.504
The answer is…

12:44.976 --> 12:47.392
Your heart, my dear Noel.

12:47.960 --> 12:50.928
[VII - The King's Vessel]

12:55.264 --> 12:57.328
No pulse…

12:58.896 --> 12:59.824
Surprised?

13:00.800 --> 13:03.088
What did you do to me?

13:03.472 --> 13:06.096
This is a skill called Judgment.

13:06.368 --> 13:10.448
It activates when you refuse
a request from me twice in a row.

13:11.056 --> 13:16.288
On that condition, I can pull a foe's heart
straight from their chest.

13:17.088 --> 13:19.488
An insta-kill skill…

13:19.904 --> 13:21.728
But I'm still alive.

13:22.128 --> 13:25.744
Because it's still linked to you.

13:26.080 --> 13:31.696
But if I get five or more meters away from you
or crush it in my hands, you're dead.

13:35.056 --> 13:42.256
Noel, my dear, you're a little…
no, much too skilled.

13:42.816 --> 13:46.816
You're sure to wreak havoc
on the Luciano family one day.

13:47.632 --> 13:49.952
There's no question about it.

13:50.495 --> 13:54.555
So you want to dispose of me
before I can bring you harm.

13:54.720 --> 13:58.448
Unfortunately, I'll have to feed you
to the pigs if nothing changes.

13:58.640 --> 14:02.752
But I'll give you one last chance
since I'm so kind.

14:03.680 --> 14:06.672
Join the Luciano family.

14:09.920 --> 14:11.312
Not possible.

14:13.040 --> 14:15.232
You plan to take your heart back?

14:15.536 --> 14:18.304
Just so you know, getting
the upper hand won't save you.

14:18.864 --> 14:23.536
Once I've taken out a heart,
it can't be put back unless I cancel the skill.

14:24.240 --> 14:27.600
Finocchio Barzini, you're correct.

14:28.576 --> 14:31.984
I'll be the ultimate Seeker one day.

14:31.984 --> 14:36.592
Not even the Luciano family
will be able to touch me then.

14:37.120 --> 14:39.440
So if you're going to kill me, now's the time.

14:39.441 --> 14:43.812
Hold on… If I drop your heart, you die instantly!
Don't you understand?

14:43.897 --> 14:45.584
You're going to kill me, aren't you?!

14:45.584 --> 14:47.216
Then do it. Kill me.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.120
Just don't forget.

14:49.120 --> 14:57.296
The second you kill me, you lose your honor
as the boss of the Barzini family.

14:57.856 --> 15:01.840
If someone's going to be trouble in the future,
kill them while they're weak.

15:02.064 --> 15:05.408
That's the right thing to do
in a dog-eat-dog world.

15:06.048 --> 15:07.152
But…

15:08.240 --> 15:12.256
That isn't what a real man would do, is it?

15:12.256 --> 15:15.889
Or I could say you're too chicken.

15:15.984 --> 15:19.024
Do you have the guts?

15:19.088 --> 15:21.552
Answer me, Finocchio!

15:22.896 --> 15:25.280
The only king I answer to is myself.

15:25.824 --> 15:28.304
I won't be bound to anyone else!

15:33.888 --> 15:35.952
No way, I…

15:42.416 --> 15:45.152
Oh, Noel, that scary look on your face!

15:45.152 --> 15:46.624
I was kidding, darling!

15:46.624 --> 15:48.992
Why would I ever kill you?

15:51.106 --> 15:53.778
Sorry I scared you.

15:53.872 --> 15:55.872
I'd best be going.

15:55.872 --> 15:57.008
Bye-bye!

15:59.712 --> 16:02.912
You better not go back
on your word, you damn brat.

16:03.488 --> 16:05.888
Now that you've beaten me in terms of guts,

16:06.128 --> 16:09.760
you'd better reach the top, or you'll pay.

16:10.592 --> 16:11.952
Naturally.

16:12.464 --> 16:14.272
Just sit back and watch.

16:21.952 --> 16:23.888
My, how frightful.

16:33.472 --> 16:35.744
F-Finocchio! Help me!

16:35.744 --> 16:38.144
Please! I don't want to die!

16:38.352 --> 16:43.232
To think there's a man who won't abandon his pride
even with his heart in my hands…

16:43.424 --> 16:47.872
Please! I swear! I'll do anything if you help me!

16:47.954 --> 16:51.024
You trash without any pride to guard…

16:53.104 --> 16:54.954
Fine. I'll help you.

16:55.072 --> 16:56.640
R-Really?!

16:57.232 --> 17:00.548
Yes. I'll keep you in my pigpen.

17:00.624 --> 17:02.720
Your… pigpen?

17:02.720 --> 17:06.912
I'll cut off your arms and legs,
so you'll be walking just like the pigs.

17:06.912 --> 17:12.912
They'll eat anything, so make sure
you play nice with them.

17:16.672 --> 17:22.848
I hope my little piggies
will like their new lover!

17:23.232 --> 17:25.328
Wait… No!

17:25.328 --> 17:28.592
Stop!

17:34.608 --> 17:39.168
So I guess this makes me your owner.

17:42.233 --> 17:44.249
But I don't want a slave.

17:44.736 --> 17:49.232
Why not? My power can be yours if you use that.

17:49.584 --> 17:52.480
Don't get full of yourself
just because you can swing a sword.

17:52.768 --> 17:56.192
Your ability is on the bottom in the Seeker world.

17:56.608 --> 17:59.520
Then… What do you want?

18:02.272 --> 18:04.352
I just want one thing.

18:04.352 --> 18:07.200
To be at the top of all Seekers.

18:07.744 --> 18:09.488
And for that goal…

18:09.600 --> 18:13.216
A starved dog at his master's beck
and call is of no use.

18:13.216 --> 18:14.976
I want a fierce wolf.

18:18.400 --> 18:19.344
Do whatever you want.

18:19.904 --> 18:21.424
You're free now.

18:22.336 --> 18:23.424
Free…

18:24.016 --> 18:25.424
So I'll ask you the same thing.

18:25.776 --> 18:27.600
What do you want?

18:28.416 --> 18:29.488
I…

18:30.176 --> 18:33.312
I've been used by others my whole life.

18:33.616 --> 18:38.672
Honestly, I don't know what to do
now that I'm free.

18:39.008 --> 18:42.096
But I do know one thing.

18:43.808 --> 18:47.968
I want to be there to see you
achieve your dream, Noel.

18:47.968 --> 18:52.208
If you want a fierce wolf, then
that's the path I should go down.

18:52.768 --> 18:54.336
So please!

18:54.528 --> 18:57.536
Let me join you!

19:02.672 --> 19:03.840
Understood.

19:06.336 --> 19:08.560
Longswordsman Koga Tsukishima.

19:08.960 --> 19:11.184
Welcome to Blue Beyond.

19:17.024 --> 19:17.792
Order!

19:25.632 --> 19:28.096
Alma! Defeat the goblin mage!

19:28.960 --> 19:29.728
Roger that!

19:32.496 --> 19:34.400
Koga! Charge into the enemy lines!

19:34.576 --> 19:36.496
Alma and I will give you an opening!

19:36.496 --> 19:37.184
Understood!

19:39.408 --> 19:40.752
Armor Piercing!

19:47.856 --> 19:48.538
Stop!

19:48.539 --> 19:49.424
[Wolf's Howl]
Stop!

19:49.425 --> 19:49.741
[Wolf's Howl]

19:50.000 --> 19:50.672
Dodge!

19:52.464 --> 19:54.064
Thunder Bullet!

19:55.856 --> 19:57.928
Koga! Subdue the general!

19:57.999 --> 19:58.593
Roger!

20:02.544 --> 20:05.696
I am… a fierce wolf!

20:08.720 --> 20:11.568
What are you doing?!

20:11.568 --> 20:14.880
It was my job to take the general's head!

20:15.536 --> 20:19.344
You were wasting time cutting off his arms,
so I just did you a favor.

20:19.440 --> 20:20.905
What…?!

20:21.808 --> 20:24.240
Got a problem with that? I'll kill you.

20:25.264 --> 20:26.832
Stop it, you two.

20:27.248 --> 20:30.816
Alma, you're not allowed to act
outside of my orders in combat again.

20:31.536 --> 20:32.144
Okay.

20:33.152 --> 20:34.528
Koga, you too.

20:35.008 --> 20:36.976
The whole party shares the rewards of battle.

20:36.976 --> 20:38.896
No one person can claim them.

20:38.896 --> 20:40.080
Don't get a big head.

20:40.384 --> 20:41.296
Got it.

20:44.016 --> 20:46.096
Anyway, good work.

20:46.384 --> 20:48.368
That was a great debut.

20:50.449 --> 20:52.545
That fight gave me proof.

20:53.664 --> 20:57.360
We have enough power to form a clan now.

20:57.944 --> 21:01.976
So as soon as we get back to the capital,
I'm submitting a clan application.

21:03.584 --> 21:05.920
Is a clan better than a party?

21:06.224 --> 21:09.696
Yeah. A clan is a nationally
recognized Seeker group.

21:10.161 --> 21:14.545
If you form a clan, you can get rewards
from the state for Abyss missions.

21:14.800 --> 21:18.272
We won't have to subcontract
for other clans like today?

21:18.375 --> 21:23.664
Exactly. There won't be a middleman to take a cut,
so we can pocket the whole reward.

21:25.178 --> 21:28.687
Once our application goes through,
we won't be a party anymore.

21:28.815 --> 21:30.143
We'll be a clan.

21:30.800 --> 21:32.784
Noel, what's that?

21:36.656 --> 21:38.848
It's his rank-up symbol.

21:38.880 --> 21:41.232
Too bad it's not on his butt.

21:42.592 --> 21:48.496
Leveled up to B-Rank.
Another step toward my target.

21:50.112 --> 21:51.152
This is where it begins.

21:51.824 --> 21:58.544
I'm going to lead the strongest members
and create the most powerful clan.

21:59.776 --> 22:03.408
To the pinnacle of regalia, seven shining stars!

23:34.976 --> 23:40.007
[IX - A Snake Hones Its Fangs]
